{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Addicted in a top-down shooter that blends chaos and strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A botched supplement changed the world. Pick your hero, face ever tougher waves, and expand your arsenal. Play solo or with friends to push further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>What to expect</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op:</strong> friends, zombies\u2014what else?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique heroes:</strong> pick your favorite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons + upgrades:</strong> new builds every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses:</strong> take down the toughest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salvation:</strong> tempt fate in search of <strong>Wonder Weapons</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atonic:</strong> boost your gun for devastating combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>How to play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter:</strong> choose a hero and starting perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt:</strong> use <strong>Salvation</strong> to roll weapons and <strong>Atonic</strong> to push them further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure:</strong> coordinate local co-op, learn boss patterns, stay alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Replayability</strong><br>Every run changes: new combos, mutators, rising difficulty, fast calls around <strong>Salvation/Atonic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Ready?</strong><br>Download the demo and add to your wishlist.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423230?t=1761166212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423230?t=1761166212","capsule_image":"http